                <pb facs="1112" n="996" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg996"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.011/12.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-01-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 16, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your January 14. Public sentiment, as far as can be observed, welcomes its
                    declarations, which are already well known.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gunther.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
